              "text": "ferrārius, ferrāriī — \"a blacksmith, an ironworker\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ferrārius soleās ferreās equīs facit. The blacksmith makes iron shoes for the horses."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Second declension, masculine: ferrārius, ferrāriī m., short for faber ferrārius. English farrier comes from it through French."
